          "points": [
            {
              "n": 1,
              "text": "1  enzymes produced when, allolactose / lactose / substrate, is present <b> </b> <b>or </b> enzymes only produced when required <b>; </b>",
              "numberedInMs": false
            },
            {
              "n": 2,
              "text": "2  genes not, expressed / switched on / transcribed, continuously <b>or</b> genes, expressed / switched on / transcribed, when, allolactose / lactose / substrate, binds to repressor <b>;</b>  <b>I</b> inducer",
